WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,730
parents

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:02,940
Let's pack up and go

3
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,140
Go to resort hotel

4
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,740
I still have a few gold boxes here

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,300
Enough for us to live for a while

6
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:08,940
Take advantage of the fact that there are fewer people going to the hotel now

7
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,940
Maybe we can rent a room, Mom, let's go

8
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,220
you are still young

9
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,380
A son who doesn’t understand the complex nature of people’s hearts

10
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,500
Think about it carefully

11
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,820
Boss Xia is a female doll

12
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:19,100
How could it be in a funeral center?

13
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,300
Open a hotel

14
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,300
Yes, listen to your mother

15
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,300
That girl is fair and tender

16
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,460
He looks like he hasn't suffered at all. There must be some conspiracy behind it.

17
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,380
let's go west

18
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,140
I heard there is a base over there called Shangyang. Go there, Mom and Dad.

19
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:30,060
Shangyang base is further away than the resort hotel

20
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,300
I'll take you by myself

21
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,500
Can't walk that far

22
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,060
If you go to a resort hotel

23
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,500
I can call all the team members over here

24
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,500
ensure safety

25
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,740
Who is it so late, aunt?

26
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:43,380
It's me, Wang Xuewei, come in quickly

27
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,700
Is there anything wrong with coming over so late?
